			"Message": "build(deps): bump @playform/compress from 0.2.2 to 0.2.3\n\nBumps [@playform/compress](https://github.com/PlayForm/Compress) from 0.2.2 to 0.2.3.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/PlayForm/Compress/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/PlayForm/Compress/blob/Current/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/PlayForm/Compress/compare/Compress/v0.2.2...Compress/v0.2.3)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@playform/compress\"\n  dependency-version: 0.2.3\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
